        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since the mass-customized treatment planning and manufacturing processes of our products require substantial and varied technical expertise, we believe our manufacturing capacity and capabilities are important to our success.",
